values ('d4e5f6a7-8b9c-4d71-8e01-1a2b3c4d5e11', 'assessment-of-learning', 'Assessment of Learning', 'This course prepares future educators to design, interpret, and use assessments that improve student learning. Students learn assessment literacy, standards alignment, formative assessment, summative assessment design, performance tasks, rubrics, portfolios, grading and reporting, data-driven instruction, standardized-test interpretation, fairness, accommodations, Universal Design for Learning, and assessment-system coherence. The course emphasizes evidence, equity, student agency, family communication, and responsible professional judgment.');

